---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Classic BMW: E28 to E90"
description: "Known issues, repair costs, guides, torque specs, and buyer's guides for the BMW E28, E30, E34, E36, E39, E46, and E90."
breadcrumbs:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "BMW" }
---
{% set b = stats.byBrand.bmw %}
<section class="brand-hero">
    <div class="brand-hero-content">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">BMW</p>
        <h1>Seven BMWs, from the E28 to the E90.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Mostly straight-sixes, mostly rear-drive, and all worth keeping on the road. Here's what goes wrong on each one and what it costs to put right.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-bar" aria-label="BMW coverage">
    <dl class="stats-container">
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Cars</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.vehicles }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Known issues</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.issues }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Guides</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.guides }}</dd></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><dt class="stat-label">Torque specs</dt><dd class="stat-number">{{ b.torqueSpecs }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section id="vehicles" class="vehicles-section">
    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">3 Series</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">The E30 through the E90: the cars most of us started with.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "bmw" %}{% set gridKeys = ["e30", "e36", "e46", "e90"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>

    <div class="brand-block">
        <div class="brand-header">
            <h2 class="brand-title">5 Series</h2>
            <p class="brand-blurb">E28, E34, and E39: big sixes, a few V8s, and the M5s.</p>
        </div>
        {% set brandKey = "bmw" %}{% set gridKeys = ["e28", "e34", "e39"] %}
        {% include "partials/vehicle-grid.njk" %}
    </div>
    {% set gridKeys = null %}
</section>

<section class="quick-search-section">
    <div class="quick-search-container">
        <h2>What are you working on?</h2>
        <p>Search every BMW page for issues, guides, specs, and parts.</p>
        <form class="home-search-form" action="/search/" method="get" role="search">
            <input type="hidden" name="brand" value="BMW">
            <label for="brand-search" class="visually-hidden">Search BMW pages</label>
            <input type="search" id="brand-search" name="q" placeholder="VANOS, cooling system, subframe…" class="home-search-input">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Search</button>
        </form>
        <p class="popular-searches">
            <span>People look up:</span>
            <a href="/search/?q=vanos&amp;brand=BMW">VANOS</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=cooling+system&amp;brand=BMW">Cooling system</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=subframe&amp;brand=BMW">Rear subframe</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=window+regulator&amp;brand=BMW">Window regulator</a>
            <a href="/search/?q=oil+leak&amp;brand=BMW">Oil leaks</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</section>
